# Generated feature stores are reproducible offline from build_store.py + the
# committed corpus; do not commit the data, only the code that makes it.
feature_store*.jsonl

# The news ledger IS committed on purpose: it is the historical economic
# calendar the corpus never had (AGENTS.md), it is decision-critical research
# input, and it is NOT reproducible offline -- it takes ~6 years of network
# fetches from the TradingView calendar. Small enough (~750 KB gz) to carry.
!news_ledger.jsonl.gz
